abstract: >-
  An audit-oriented real-plane laboratory and Lean 4 formalization for finite
  native carry operators, including all-base centered camera geometry,
  CPU/CUDA discovery, arbitrary-precision Ridder localization without Newton,
  cutoff convergence ledgers, dyadic asymptotic tail correction, and formal
  interfaces for future interval certification.
keywords:
  - finite operator
  - carry geometry
  - centered differences
